        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.vesselAI-project.eu/ontology#Trajectory"/>
        <rdfs:comment>A trajectory of a vessel can be considered as dangerous for various reasons, varying from simply its load to more sophisticated data analysis based on its type, speed and region of activity</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Class>
    


