    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://www.vesselAI-project.eu/ontology#HighSpeed">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.vesselAI-project.eu/ontology#Vessel"/>
        <rdfs:comment>High-speed craft is a craft capable of a maximum speed, in metres per second (m/s), equal to or exceeding 3.7 times the one-sixth power of the volume of displacement corresponding to the design waterline (m³), excluding craft the hull of which is supported completely clear above the water surface in non-displacement mode by aerodynamic forces generated by ground effect. (SOLAS X/1.2, HSC Code 2000 para 1.4.30)</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Class>
    


